    "task_agent.py 源码中存在严重的冗余粘贴复制：_render_turn_summary, _render_vote_summary, _render_speak_summary, _rank_candidates, _least_suspicious_candidate, _score_candidate, _candidate_pool, _extract_public_notes, _walk_public_payload, _snapshot_mapping, _extract_player_ids 等大量方法在文件中被完全重复定义了两次。",
